Platform integration: theme, crypto, accessibility, input, screen, editing.

Form controls, scrollbars and media controls use WebCore's own Adwaita theme.
WebCrypto uses the OpenSSL implementation. The accessibility tree is built as
on every port and read on demand by the embedder; platform notifications are
dropped. Pasteboard and editor reuse the PasteboardStrategy-based
implementation. Keyboard modifiers are the ones the embedder sets; screen
geometry is pushed from the host page. A Linux WebKit user agent and a built-in
MIME table complete the platform layer.

